  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion (config_033) achieve the highest accuracy so far (0.713). This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with the more powerful imagenet_vit_l image encoder while keeping other components the same, to determine if the stronger image encoder further improves performance. This isolates the effect of the image encoder, a critical design choice, and leverages the strong prior evidence for the other components."
}

